{"2871490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Turkeygeddon: Feast of Fury", "steam_appid": 2871490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4892940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871490/extras/93f364fc6357f432b7ca3a47817654d4.webp?t=1783525234\" width=275 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab some friends (or go solo) and jump into a chaotic bullet-heaven, couch co-op, wave survival, twin-stick shooter for 1–8 players. Blast through swarms of strange turkeys, fight crazy bosses, scoop up coins and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, level up, purchase items or upgrade weapons in the shop to build ridiculous loadouts that get more and more unhinged as the waves ramp up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then hold the line as arena hazards and surprise events turn every run into a new kind of chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871490/extras/e394f2a099d2a5c8cc7164cb5d25cea5.webp?t=1783525234\" width=275 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-8 player co-op (and solo play)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally or online with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, wave-based runs: 20 waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up to upgrade your stats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and buy items + weapon upgrades between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed stat system, every choice is a trade off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles that test your builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic arena events and hazards that shake up the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Mode,